  <running_head>THEOD. BEZÆ</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Seruir</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Volucris ecce fluxerant iam iam mihi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2" para="true">
      <i>Ter fena lustra aui, atque originem in clyta,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>Magnisq; opibus florente duxeram domo:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Sed nobiles proauos habentem quid iuuat</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Optima possidere latifundia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">
      <i>Magnósque honores, si Patris summi loco,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">
      <i>Potente qui Verbo feracem condidit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Tellurem, &amp; immensos polorum fornices,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Quis ligna cogatur dolata, &amp; saxeos</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Vocare Dinos, atque pinguioribus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Satiare mutas Victimis imagines?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>Hac ergo despexi, meis simul tua</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Vox infonuit auribus, &amp; impiis statim.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Migrare terris imperasti nescium</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Promissa qua me rura Velles Visere.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Verum lubens quicunque te sequitur ducem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Iter tenebit rectum, &amp; auius procul</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Erroribus tutas secabit orbitas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Sara. Abrahamus.</l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="1" para="true">SARA.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Quoties memori renoluo corde quot bona</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Sis Vsque largitus mihi, ter Optime</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Parens, Viaque fidus ignota comes,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>Seu me laborum coniugis certam pij</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Sociam, thorique pacta mutui Abraha.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>Iurata seruantem pudico pectore</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27" para="true">
      <i>Non barbarorum giueris libidini</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28" para="true">
      <i>Seruir</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Faint show-through and stains throughout; the final line is cut off at the page edge and partly illegible. Several letters in the verse are blurred, so the italic readings are approximate.</notes>
